WEBVTT

00:00:00.359 --> 00:00:04.930
Price spent the week inside a range. That

00:00:04.930 --> 00:00:09.319
is a description of the path, not an

00:00:09.715 --> 00:00:12.842
instruction. EXAMPLE the sketch marks 90

00:00:12.842 --> 00:00:18.906
and 110. Those marks are a drawing. They

00:00:18.906 --> 00:00:21.818
are not a forecast. A market check names

00:00:22.085 --> 00:00:25.475
what changed. The week stayed between the

00:00:25.475 --> 00:00:31.406
two marks. A close inside the range is

00:00:31.406 --> 00:00:33.583
still just a close. The gap under the

00:00:33.731 --> 00:00:37.586
range is the buffer. When the buffer

00:00:37.586 --> 00:00:41.854
shrinks, the plan is under stress. Stress

00:00:42.009 --> 00:00:44.232
means read the picture again. It is not

00:00:44.232 --> 00:00:49.909
a call to buy or sell. Say the

00:00:49.909 --> 00:00:52.747
high, the low, and the gap. If a

00:00:53.352 --> 00:00:55.738
number is on the page, it carries the

00:00:55.738 --> 00:01:02.290
word EXAMPLE. Write those three words down

00:01:02.290 --> 00:01:04.335
before you leave the page. This is

00:01:05.184 --> 00:01:07.364
education, not financial advice.
